  summation of float32 values is the npm dependency
  @stdlib/blas-ext-base-ssumpw, Copyright (c) The Stdlib Authors, Apache
  License 2.0. The package does not include their code.
- scikit-learn 1.9.1 (sklearn.metrics.auc and average_precision_score,
  paired_cosine_distances, paired_euclidean_distances,
  paired_manhattan_distances, normalize, row_norms, v_measure_score,
