The npm dependency hyparquet (Hyperparam, MIT License) reads the parquet
files. The package does not include its code.

The npm dependency ml-matrix (mljs, MIT License) calculates the singular value
decomposition of the least squares. The package does not include its code.

The npm dependency heap (Xueqiao Xu, MIT License), a port of the heapq module
of CPython, keeps the documents of a search. The package does not include its
code.

The npm dependency cephes (NearForm, BSD 3-Clause License, and the Cephes
license of Stephen L. Moshier) gives scipy.special.gammaln: the lgam of Cephes,
compiled to WebAssembly. The package does not include its code.

The npm dependency rapidfuzz-js (MIT License) gives the fuzzy matching of
codecarbon's TDP table. The package does not include its code.

The npm dependency @huggingface/tokenizers (Hugging Face, Apache License 2.0)
runs the tokenizer.json files of the HuggingFace Hub. The package does not
include its code.

